&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The US base hourly salary range for this full-time position is $24.27 to $30.76 + equity + benefits. Our salary ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, location, and relevant education or training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the compensation details listed in US role postings reflect the base salary only, and do not include equity or benefits&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Demands&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
