&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The US base hourly range for this part-time position is $25.00-$35.00 an hour. Our hourly ranges are determined by role, level, and location. Within the range, individual pay is determined by additional factors, including job-related skills, experience, location, and relevant education or training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
